 "edits": [
  {
   "path": "sections.story.0.zh",
   "before": "据达尔文本人所说，那份旧手稿从未打算发表：1858年，他为它加了一条脚注，署“C. D. 1858”，说明这份手稿从未打算发表，因此写得并不仔细。",
   "after": "第一份材料是达尔文那份关于物种的手稿的摘录；信中说要向学会宣读的只是其中选段，不是整部手稿。据达尔文本人所说，那份旧手稿从未打算发表：1858年，他为它加了一条脚注，署“C. D. 1858”，说明这份手稿从未打算发表，因此写得并不仔细。",
   "issues": [
    "F1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "path": "sections.story.0.en",
   "before": "By Darwin's own account, his old manuscript was never intended for publication. In 1858 he added a footnote to it: \"This MS. work was never intended for publication, and therefore was not written with care.—C. D. 1858.\"",
   "after": "The first item was extracts from Darwin's manuscript on species; the letter says only extracts were to be read to the Society, not the whole manuscript. By Darwin's own account, his old manuscript was never intended for publication. In 1858 he added a footnote to it: \"This MS. work was never intended for publication, and therefore was not written with care.—C. D. 1858.\"",
